      <Docs>
        <summary>Trigger occurs after an ANR has been identified, but before the system would attempt to kill the app. The trigger does not necessarily indicate that the app was killed due to the ANR. System will provide a snapshot of a running system trace in response to this trigger.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>
