              <a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/os/ProfilingTrigger#TRIGGER_TYPE_ANR" title="Reference documentation">Java documentation for <code>android.os.ProfilingTrigger.TRIGGER_TYPE_ANR</code>.</a>
            </format>
          </para>
